flowchart TD
  U[User request] --> P[Planner: typed task graph]
  P --> V{Graph valid?}
  V -- no --> R[Reject plan]
  V -- yes --> S[Scheduler: bounded concurrency]
  S --> D{Dependencies succeeded?}
  D -- no --> F[Fail dependent task]
  D -- yes --> W[Worker executes scoped action]
  W --> I[Idempotency ledger]
  I --> C[Checkpoint journal]
  C --> Q{Task outcome}
  Q -- success --> N[Unlock dependents]
  Q -- retryable failure --> T[Bounded retry]
  T --> W
  Q -- terminal failure --> X[Compensation / escalation]
  N --> S
  X --> C
  C --> Z[Auditable terminal state]
